sequenceDiagram
actor User
participant Client
participant "Auth Controller" as Controller
participant "Auth Service" as Service
participant "User Repository" as Repo
participant "OTP Service" as OTP
participant "Email Service" as Email
database DB

User ->> Client: Enter email
Client ->> Controller: POST /auth/forgot-password

Controller ->> Service: forgotPassword(email)

Service ->> Repo: findByEmail(email)
Repo ->> DB: SELECT user WHERE email = ?
DB -->> Repo: User / null
Repo -->> Service: User / null

Service ->> OTP: Generate OTP
OTP -->> Service: OTP Code

Service ->> Email: Send OTP(email, code)
Email -->> Service: Email sent

Service -->> Controller: Success
Controller -->> Client: 200 OTP sent successfully